	<td width="100%" align="left" valign="top">
			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100%" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="center" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Tellurian Recruit </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Summons an earth elemental Fighter. (Controllable) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Agitation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Augments the caster&#39;s pet with a variety of offensive and defensive abilities. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Earthly Brand </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases Stamina and Intelligence attributes, and Cold mitigation for the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Dust Blast </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals magic damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13.2 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Aqueous Stone </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Summons an item into the target group member&#39;s inventory that can be activated to grant water-breathing. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13.4 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Summon Servant </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">(not implemented) &nbsp;Summons caster&#39;s pet(s) to their side. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">14 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Soothe Servant </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Health instantly to the caster&#39;s pet. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Sorcerer/Enchanter/Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lightning Surge </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Does instant Magic damage to the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Essence Shift </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Converts pet health to summoner power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Petrify </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Stuns the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">16.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Seism </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Teleports the caster&#39;s pet(s) back to the caster. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Bludgeoning Earth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals magic damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">18.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Splinter of Essence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Summons a consumable on the target party member that restores Power at the cost of Health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Immobilize </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Roots the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grim Spellbinder </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Summons an evil spirit of the Warlock profession. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Nylphs Bone Form </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Illusion </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Favor of the Fallen </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups power pool, magic &amp; noxious resistance, and increases pets hit points. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Blight </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect disease damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Swarm of Rats </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Summons a pack of plague rats that fight for the caster until the spell expires. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Unliving Eyes </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grants see invisible to the group. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">23.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Party See Invisibility </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants ability to see invisible (but not hidden) entities to each party member. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Undying Adherent </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Summons an undead fighter (pet). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grisly Mark </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment that decreases Stamina and Wisdom, and drains Power over-time on the target opponent. If the target opponent is slain while under this spell, an Essence of Anguish is granted. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mark of Miasmic </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups stamina, intelligence, and disease resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bloody Ritual </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Drains life from the pet and converts it to power for the caster over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grisly Brace </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that absorbs an amount of Trauma and Noxious damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Mend Bones </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Transfers health from the caster to the pet. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Pestilential Blast </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals disease damage and has a chance to reduce noxious resist with each successful attack by an ally. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Breath of the Unearthed </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Area of effect disease damage over time. A portion of damage done is given back to the caster as health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grasping Bones </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Stuns the target and increase pet damage for a short period of time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Nylphs Flayed Form </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Illusion </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Withering Affliction </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Disease damage over time and decreases the targets strength and agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shadowy Stalker </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Summons a shadowy Assassin. (Controllable) </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cloak of Venril </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grants invisibility to the target and lifetap if attacked. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Chains of Torment </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Roots the target and does disease damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Dark Heart </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Summons a bauble which restores power over time at the cost of health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grim Thulian </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Summons an evil spirit of the Warlock profession. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Ghastly Stench </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Does Disease damage over-time and decreases Noxious mitigation on the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Nylphs Ghostly Visage </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Illusion </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Unholy Covenant </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases the groups power pool, magic &amp; noxious resistance, and increases pets health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">36 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Locust Swarm </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Area of effect disease damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">37 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Plague of Rats </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Summons a pack of plague rats that fight for the caster until the spell expires. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Terror </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Causes the target opponent to flee in fear. Costs Power periodically and completely immobilizes the caster throughout the duration of the spell. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Rotting Thrall </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Mezs the target, cannot be interrupted or fizzle. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Words of the Wicked </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants the casters pet a proc that increases the pets hate level with the target and deals a lifetap. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">39.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Horrific Mark </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Impairment that decreases Stamina and Wisdom, and drains Power over-time on the target opponent. If the target opponent is slain while under this spell, an Essence of Anguish is granted. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Teachings of the Dead </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases groups stamina, intelligence, and disease resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Dartains Dead Sight </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shows a heat profile of all living creatures in view. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Rending Fury </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Pet Buff: increases damage and grants a special ability to counterattack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Devour Health </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Convers the pets health to the casters power over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Necrotic Mending </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Transfers health over time from the caster to the pet. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">42.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grisly Stele </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation that absorbs an amount of Trauma and Noxious damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">43 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deathly Pallor </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Causes the necromancer to appear dead. As a side effect, all summoned minions are banished. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">43 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Skinrot </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals noxious damage and has a chance to reduce the targets noxious resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Accursed Cloud </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Area of effect disease damage over time, a portion of damage done is returned to the caster as health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Convulse </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Stuns the target and increases pet damage (to the same target). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Siphon Life </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">&nbsp;Does instant Disease damage to the target, and returns a portion of this damage as Health replenishment to the caster. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Nylphs Skeleton Regiment </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Group Illusion. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deaths Coil </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deals disease damage over timeand reduces the targets strength and agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Fade </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grants invisiblity. If broken it procs a lifetap on the attacker. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Shadowy Assassin </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Summons a shadow assassin (pet). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Eternal Bindings </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Roots the target and deals disease damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Sacrificial Heart </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Summons a bauble which restores power over time at the cost of health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">48 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Grim terror </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Summons a Warlock (pet). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">48 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Revivication </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Non combat rez (requires an essence of anguish). </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Aspect of Undead </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups power pool, magic &amp; noxious resistance, and increased pet health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Stench of the Grave </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals disease damage over time and lowers noxious resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Dartains Cloaking Debris </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Encases the caster in swirling debris. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lich </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Converts health to power over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Necromancer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Torrential Plague </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Area of effect disease damage and additional disease damage over time to the target. </td></tr></tbody></table>
	
